WEBVTT

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.081
and finds a group of young
African-American men playing dice.

00:06:05.293 --> 00:06:08.272
This is about 1990,
peak of the crack epidemic.

00:06:08.296 --> 00:06:10.454
This is a very dangerous job,
being in a gang.

00:06:10.478 --> 00:06:11.993
You don't like to be surprised.

00:06:12.017 --> 00:06:15.530
You don't like to be surprised
by people who come around the corner.

00:06:15.554 --> 00:06:18.878
And the mantra was:
shoot first; ask questions later.

00:06:18.902 --> 00:06:21.084
Now, Sudhir was lucky --
he was such a freak,

00:06:21.108 --> 00:06:23.319
and that clipboard
probably saved his life,

00:06:23.343 --> 00:06:25.566
because they figured no other
rival gang member

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:28.085
would be coming up to shoot
at them with a clipboard.

00:06:28.109 --> 00:06:29.110
(Laughter)

00:06:29.134 --> 00:06:32.165
So his greeting was not particularly
warm, but they did say,